{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52370","headline":"回波乐 十三 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"法性本来常存，茫茫无有边畔。\n安身取舍之中，被他二境回换。\n歛念定（任录作「之」）想坐禅，摄意安心觉观。\n木人机关（任录作「挟开」）修道，何时可到彼岸？\n忽悟诸法体空，欲似热病得汗。\n无智人前莫说，打破君头万段。\n（按：项楚谓本首及前「回波尔时六贼」一首均系据宝志《大乘赞》改写而成。\n宝志之作见本书卷五十九。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52370.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52370","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}